# Normalise line endings to LF everywhere. gofmt and go/format emit LF, and this repo is
# developed on Windows, Linux and macOS, so a single ending keeps the three in agreement.
#
# eol=lf rather than plain text=auto: text=auto alone stores LF but still checks out CRLF on
# Windows, which leaves gofmt reporting every file as unformatted there.
* text=auto eol=lf
